OL,3,GNEWSALord Blunkett 'deeply' regrets his
OL,4,AHillsborough response
OL,5,
OL,6,FLord Blunkett has said he "deeply"
OL,7,Fregrets not doing more for Hillsborough
OL,8,Ffamilies while he was home secretary.
OL,10,FThe Labour peer told the House of Lords
OL,11,Fthat the decades-long wait for the
OL,12,FHillsborough Law could have been
OL,13,F"shortened enormously" if politicians
OL,14,Fhad taken more responsibility.
OL,16,FThe peer represented Sheffield
OL,17,FBrightside, which included Hillsborough
OL,18,FStadium, when the 1989 disaster took
OL,19,Fplace, claiming 97 lives. He was home
OL,20,Fsecretary from 2001 to 2004.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
