OL,3,GNEWSALord Blunkett 'deeply' regrets his
OL,4,AHillsborough response
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe spoke during a Lords debate on the
OL,7,FPublic Office (Accountability) Bill,
OL,8,Fknown as the Hillsborough Law, which
OL,9,Fwould require public officials and
OL,10,Fauthorities to tell the truth during
OL,11,Finvestigations and inquiries.
